FreeGrok is the CloudBSD / RevyTech fork of the open-source Grok Build
CLI (terminal AI coding agent). It is a fullscreen TUI that edits files,
runs shell commands, and manages long-running tasks.

This is not an official xAI or FreeBSD package.

Sandbox isolation on FreeBSD uses a jail backend (helper still landing);
Landlock/Seatbelt (nono) is Linux/macOS only. Install textproc/ripgrep
for the system rg binary.

On first run FreeGrok copies ~/.grok (grok-build configs) to ~/.freegrok.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/freegrok
